    "",
    "&8───────────────",
    "",
    "The &lFluid Manager&r can be used to move fluids between all &lCasting&r blocks. ",
    "",
    "To extract fluids hold the &lFluid Manager&r in your Main Hand a hold Shift and Scroll to get to Empty. Then right click on the &lCasting&r block to take the fluid. To insert you do the same thing except select the fluid you want to insert "
  ],
